# Grok Bot branch sync

Grok Bot actively updates this repo on branch `cursor/fleet-pivot-693e`.

## When working in this project

- At the start of a session (and periodically while developing), run:
  `git pull origin cursor/fleet-pivot-693e`
- Prefer staying on `cursor/fleet-pivot-693e` unless the user asks otherwise.
- After a pull that changes app code, rely on Next.js hot reload; restart `npm run dev` if deps, env, or config changed.
- Do not overwrite Grok Bot remote work with force-push unless the user explicitly requests it.
